    "_comments": [
      "Fields hidden from the generated form. Two kinds, both of which showed up as noise on screen.",
      "",
      "RootParentContractID / RootSupersededByContractID are OUTER APPLY outputs of the",
      "fnContract*_GetRootID functions CodeGen adds to the base view for self-referencing FKs. They are",
      "real and useful in a query; on a form they render as a raw UUID under a label a user cannot",
      "interpret, which is exactly what was on screen.",
      "",
      "The derived lifecycle columns are hidden because our own panels present them WITH their meaning:",
      "State is the hero's chip, IsAwaitingDocument is a hero warning, RenewalNoticeDeadline is the",
      "renewal panel's deadline line, DaysToEnd is 'in 4 months' on the hero. Left in the field list they",
      "appear a second time as bare values — 'DAYS TO END 487' tells a reader less than 'in 16 months'.",
      "",
      "IncludeInGeneratedForm is the flag; it does NOT affect the base view, the API or a RunView — the",
      "columns stay fully available to code and to grids."
    ],
